# nishu.dev Project Context (LLM Token-Optimized)
# Format: Compact YAML-like DSL | Version: 1.0.0 | Updated: 2026-08-31

PROJECT:
  name: nishu.dev
  type: Next.js Portfolio Web App
  owner: Nishan Rajak (Backend Engineer / Student @ ICFAI Univ Jharkhand)
  repo: nishuR31/nishu.dev
  live_url: https://nishudevportfolio.vercel.app
  api_default: https://nishu-dev-api.onrender.com

TECH_STACK:
  framework: Next.js 16.2.1 (App Router, JS/TS hybrid)
  react: 18.3.1
  state: Redux Toolkit 2.12.0 (@reduxjs/toolkit, react-redux 9.3.0)
  styling: TailwindCSS 3.4.14 + styled-components 6.5.1 + tailwindcss-animate + lucide-react
  data_fetching: useSWR 2.4.1 + standard fetch API
  image_format: AVIF (public/projects/*.avif, logo-84.avif, logo-180.avif, logo.avif)
  package_manager: bun (bun.lock authoritative, package-lock.json present)

ENV_VARS:
  NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL: Backend API root (default: https://nishu-dev-api.onrender.com)
  NEXT_PUBLIC_FRONTEND_URL: Site canonical root (default: https://nishudevportfolio.vercel.app)
  NEXT_PUBLIC_SERVICE_ID: EmailJS service key
  NEXT_PUBLIC_TEMPLATE_ID: EmailJS template key
  NEXT_PUBLIC_PUBLIC_KEY: EmailJS public key

ROUTING_STRUCTURE:
  app/layout.js: Root layout, fonts (GeistVF, Outfit), providers, structured JSON-LD, global grid background
  app/(home)/page.jsx: Home route (/), lazy section rendering, footer CTAs
  app/(projects)/projects/page.jsx: All projects grid (/projects)
  app/(certificates)/certificates/page.jsx: Certificate showcase (/certificates)
  app/contact/page.tsx: Contact form page (/contact)
  app/settings/page.tsx: Settings page (/settings)
  app/not-found.tsx: 404 error handler
  app/error.tsx: Runtime boundary error fallback

STATE_MANAGEMENT:
  store/configStore.ts: Redux store setup (portfolioSlice, themeSlice)
  store/index.ts: Custom hooks (`useTheme`, `usePortfolio`)
  slices/portfolioSlice.ts: Redux slice (`portfolioData`, `portfolioLoading`, `portfolioError`)
  slices/themeSlice.ts: Redux slice (`theme`: "dark" | "light" | "system")

CORE_COMPONENTS:
  components/Header/index.tsx: Responsive navbar, logo, theme toggle, mobile drawer
  components/Footer/index.jsx: Social links, copyright, quick links
  components/ui/page-loader.jsx: Modal loader overlay (styled-components + bg-black/80)
  components/ui/mouse-glow.jsx: Mouse glow tracker (React state mousemove listener)
  components/ui/background-effects.jsx: Ambient glow background gradients
  components/ui/reveal-on-scroll.jsx: IntersectionObserver scroll reveal wrapper
  components/ui/skeletons.jsx: Loading skeletons for About, Hero, Experience, Projects
  components/ImageWithAvif.jsx: Dynamic webp to avif fallback image wrapper

DATA_SCHEMA (lib/portfolio-fallback.ts):
  developer: { name, shortName, role, tagline, bio, location, email, about[] }
  featuredProjects: string[] (project identifiers)
  social: { github, discord, linkedin, leetcode, hackerone }
  NAV_ITEMS: { href, label }[]
  projects: { id, title, description, image, technologies[], github, demo }[]
  skills: { title, iconKey, description, bgClass, iconClass, skills: { name, level, hot? }[] }[]
  experiences: { position, company, period, location, description, responsibilities[], technologies[] }[]
  contactInfo: { iconKey, label, value, link }[]
  certificates: { url }[] (30 items)
  additionalProjects: string[]
  strengths: string[]

AUDIT_DEFECTS_AND_BOTTLENECK_MAP:
  DEFECT_1: `usePortfolio()` in store/index.ts executes un-cached `fetch('/portfolio', {cache:'no-store'})` in 13+ component useEffects.
  DEFECT_2: app/(home)/page.jsx wraps home sections (About, Experience, Skills, Certs, Github) in dynamic(..., {ssr:false, loading: PageLoader}).
  DEFECT_3: components/ui/page-loader.jsx uses `fixed inset-0 bg-black/80` causing light-theme viewport darkening during section loads.
  DEFECT_4: app/(home)/components/GithubProjects.tsx fetches `per_page=${6*page}` then filters, causing missing repos & broken `(data.length > projects.length)` Load More condition.
  DEFECT_5: Fallback data lists `/projects/project-1.webp` while disk assets are `/projects/project-1.avif`.
  DEFECT_6: Hardcoded stats in About.tsx (10+ certs vs 30 actual) & SectionTitle.jsx (5+ projects, <1 yr exp).
  DEFECT_7: Dual source of truth for skills in SkillsShowcase.tsx vs portfolio-fallback.ts.
  DEFECT_8: MouseGlow.jsx triggers 60fps React state renders on mousemove instead of RAF/ref direct DOM update.
  DEFECT_9: Lockfile drift (package.json vs package-lock.json/bun.lock for typescript 5.9/7.0 & eslint 9/10).
  DEFECT_10: `next lint` script obsolete in Next 16 (switch to `eslint .`).

ARCHITECTURE_TARGET_STATE:
  SERVER_FETCH: Single cached server function `getPortfolioData()` in `lib/portfolio.ts` (revalidate: 3600).
  SSR_FIRST: Server render Hero, About, Experience, Skills. Hydrate Github & Certificate islands on client.
  GITHUB_SERVER_CACHE: Server endpoint `getGithubRepos()` fetching 100 repos, cached 1hr, local UI filtering/slicing.
  CERT_SCHEMA_ENHANCEMENT: Explicit `{id, title, issuer, category, issuedAt, featured, url}` schema. Show 6 featured on homepage, 30 on /certificates page.
  PROOF_OF_WORK: Structured experience items with type (internship/hackathon/freelance), verifiable links, achievements.
